  "body": "## 🚀 Features\n  \n- Add elasticLoadBalancing to kubernetesNetworkConfig (#8909)\n- Add --cfn-disable-termination-protection flag to opt out of CloudForm… (#8900)\n\n## 🎯 Improvements\n\n- Scope IRSA trust for EBS/EFS CSI add-on roles to the add-on service account (#8924)\n- Add get and list secrets permissions to emr-containers role (#8915)\n- Use the EKS default Kubernetes version when --version is not set (#8905)\n\n## 🐛 Bug Fixes\n\n- Scope IRSA trust for EBS/EFS CSI add-on roles to the add-on service account (#8924)\n\n## 🧰 Maintenance\n\n- Fix/integration test failures (#8926)\n- Update coredns (#8883)\n- Remove go.mod replace pins and apply blocked dependency updates (#8918)\n- test: disable self-registration on the identity provider test's Cognito user pool (#8914)\n\n## Acknowledgments\n\nThe eksctl maintainers would like to sincerely thank @DerekFrank, @jupdec, @knottnt, @kprahulraj, @naclonts, @sapphirew, @siddharthkhialani, @michaelbeaumont, @rhaowang and Siddharth Khialani.\n\n",
